    "work": "Both *py and **ppz reach c, and x is only a copy. **ppz += 1 makes c = 5, and z = 5. *py += 2 makes c = 7, and y = 7. x is still the copy 4, so x += 3 makes x = 7. The return value is 7 + 7 + 5 = 19.",
